  "body": "This release focuses on fixing issues with the doasedit script which is used to more safely edit files as another user. The main change is doasedit now properly handles situations where the full path name of a text file is used, in other words path names with a leading slash character, like \"/etc/doas.conf\".\r\n\r\nAlso updated manual page to indicate limitations when using piping on Linux.\r\n\r\nCleaned up error checking when dealing with temporary text files.",
